		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">35</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">This is correct answer.

We need to print the number whose frequency is same as that of its value.Here all three elements have satisfy that criteria. So all three(i.e 1,2,3) are lucky numbers

But If we have more than one lucky number then we have to print the number which has occured first(element with least index). Here number 1 has occured first so output is 1</attribute>
			<section name="graphics">
				<attribute key="x" type="double">1295.6545379730198</attribute>
				<attribute key="y" type="double">3229.1080421149204</attribute>
				<attribute key="w" type="double">337.8368717453759</attribute>
				<attribute key="h" type="double">153.10747790036942</attribute>
				<attribute key="type" type="String">rectangle</attribute>
				<attribute key="raisedBorder" type="boolean">false</attribute>
				<attribute key="fill" type="String">#FFCC00</attribute>
