		<section name="node">
			<attribute key="id" type="int">37</attribute>
			<attribute key="label" type="String">Following are some hints for coming up with new test cases.

1. Normal test cases - length of the list is like 5, 8, 10 etc.
1.1 Numbers are consecutive positive integers
1.2. All numbers are different but not connsecutive

2. Boundary test cases
2.1. All the vlaues in the list are same
2.2. List have multiple values and last value is lucky number
2.3. List contains multiple values, all values are lucky number
2.4. List contains multiple values, and none of them are lucky number


Based on these hints, you can come up with at least 10 new test cases.
Write them on a paper along with the expected output.</attribute>
